          "label": "求 $Tf(x)$",
          "steps": [
            "$\\int_0^x t^2\\,dt=\\dfrac{x^3}{3}$，故 $\\dfrac{1}{x}\\int_0^x t^2dt=\\dfrac{x^2}{3}$",
            "$f'(x)=2x$",
            "$Tf(x)=\\dfrac{x^2}{3}+2x$",
            "核对：原题公式取 $a=1,b=0,c=0$ 给出 $Tf(x)=\\frac{1}{3}x^2+(0+2)x+0=\\frac{x^2}{3}+2x$，一致"
          ]
