    },
    {
      "text": "证明：对任意一次多项式 $f(x)=bx+c$ 和正整数 $n$，都有 $T^nf(x)=\\dfrac{b}{2^n}x+(c+2b)-\\dfrac{2b}{2^n}$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "线性递推数列的通项公式",
        "数学归纳法",
        "等比数列求和"
      ],
      "question_type": "递推公式的一般化证明",
      "method": [
        "建立递推关系",
        "求解递推得通项",
        "用归纳法或求和验证"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "写出递推 $b_{n+1}=b_n/2,\\ c_{n+1}=c_n+b_n$",
        "解出 $b_n$",
        "对 $c_n$ 求和得通项",
        "整理成待证形式"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "linear_recurrence_closed_form",
        "template": "b_{n+1}=b_n/2, c_{n+1}=c_n+b_n; find b_n, c_n",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "证明",
          "steps": [
            "由 (1) 的 $a=0$ 情形，$T$ 把 $(b_n,c_n)$ 映为 $(b_{n+1},c_{n+1})=(b_n/2,\\,c_n+b_n)$，初值 $(b_0,c_0)=(b,c)$",
            "由 $b_{n+1}=b_n/2$ 立得 $b_n=b/2^n$",
            "对 $c_n$：$c_n=c+\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}b_k=c+b\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}(1/2)^k=c+b\\cdot 2\\left(1-\\frac{1}{2^n}\\right)=c+2b-\\frac{2b}{2^n}$",
            "故 $T^nf(x)=b_nx+c_n=\\dfrac{b}{2^n}x+(c+2b)-\\dfrac{2b}{2^n}$，命题得证"
          ]
        }
      ],
